  {
   "line": 8,
   "text": "That's convolution: building the output as a sum of shifted copies of the impulse response, each scaled by one input sample. The book writes it x star h, and that star is not multiplication. Multiply hi by h sample by sample, and every product has a zero in it. No echo at all.",
