  {
   "line": 9,
   "text": "Here's the fix. Your equipment saw every sample of the caller's voice, and you measured h. So compute the echo yourself: point four times the voice two thousand samples back, plus point two times the voice two thousand and one samples back. Subtract that guess from what arrives. The echo is gone, and the far voice comes through at full size.",
